 Provides: historic-routing-abi (= 0.31d801c-27f287be9)
 Section: net
 Priority: optional
 Homepage: https://github.com/lichenlang89/historic-routing
 Description: FRRouting-based framework for historic routing protocols
  (development build, NOT released)
  .
  historic-routing 是一个独立项目：以 FRRouting 为底层框架，
  复活已经退出主流使用的历史路由协议（EGP、GGP、HELLO…）。
  本项目不是 FRRouting 官方项目。
  .
  This package ships the shared framework of one specific build:
  the runtime library (libfrr.so.0), zebra, vtysh and the configuration
  skeleton. Everything is installed under the project prefix
  recorded in BUILD-INFO.txt and does not touch the distribution FRR
  (/usr/sbin/frr*, /etc/frr, /usr/lib/*/frr, frr.service).
  .
  NOTE: this is a development build (see Version and BUILD-INFO.txt for the
  source commit); it is not a released version. Its zebra and the distribution
  frr.service both program the kernel RIB, so they must not run at the same
  time.
